  "description": "Inject bold urban swagger and authentic street culture into your designs with Chicano Style, a dynamic graffiti font! Inspired by classic West Coast lettering, lowrider graphics, and hand-style graffiti art, this typeface features expressive, sweeping marker strokes and confident, exaggerated letterforms that demand attention.\nWhether you’re creating hip-hop album covers, streetwear apparel designs, skate culture graphics, tattoo studio branding, poster headlines, or event flyers, Chicano Style delivers a raw, edgy aesthetic that captures the authentic vibe of street art.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Inject bold urban swagger and authentic street culture into your designs with Chicano Style, a dynamic graffiti font! Inspired by classic West Coast lettering, lowrider graphics, and hand-style graffiti art, this typeface features expressive, sweeping marker strokes and confident, exaggerated letterforms that demand attention.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re creating hip-hop album covers, streetwear apparel designs, skate culture graphics, tattoo studio branding, poster headlines, or event flyers, Chicano Style delivers a raw, edgy aesthetic that captures the authentic vibe of street art.</p>",
